{"turn_id": "d12-t1", "session_id": "d12", "turn": 1, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "bert_f1", "text": "经过微调的基于BERT的模型在概念识别（CR）任务上取得了0.89的F1分数。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2003.11687", "chunk_id": "c-35ae853dec5dd79f61ef4980"}]}, {"key": "data_split", "text": "训练和评估采用了80-20的数据划分。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2003.11687", "chunk_id": "c-35ae853dec5dd79f61ef4980"}]}, {"key": "model_choice", "text": "作者选择了BERT，因为其通用性以及使用上下文化词嵌入，并使用预训练的cased语言模型进行多类分类。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2003.11687", "chunk_id": "c-35ae853dec5dd79f61ef4980"}]}, {"key": "spacy_similar", "text": "作者还用spaCy实现了CR，其结果与BERT模型相似。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2003.11687", "chunk_id": "c-35ae853dec5dd79f61ef4980"}]}, {"key": "details_in_tables", "text": "CR的更详细性能见表2和表3。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2003.11687", "chunk_id": "c-35ae853dec5dd79f61ef4980"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d12-t1", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
{"turn_id": "d12-t2", "session_id": "d12", "turn": 2, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "bert_f1_score", "text": "微调后的预训练BERT模型在概念识别任务上给出了0.89的F1分数。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2003.11687", "chunk_id": "c-35ae853dec5dd79f61ef4980"}]}, {"key": "data_split", "text": "训练和评估采用了80-20的数据划分。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2003.11687", "chunk_id": "c-35ae853dec5dd79f61ef4980"}]}, {"key": "model_choice", "text": "作者选择BERT，是因其通用性以及使用了上下文化词嵌入；他们使用BERT的预训练cased语言模型进行多类分类。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2003.11687", "chunk_id": "c-35ae853dec5dd79f61ef4980"}]}, {"key": "fine_tuning_setup", "text": "文本被嵌入为带有最大token长度的tokens和masks，这些嵌入后的tokens被作为输入提供给预训练BERT模型进行完全微调；实现使用pytorch transformers和hugging face，并采用BertForTokenClassification。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2003.11687", "chunk_id": "c-35ae853dec5dd79f61ef4980"}]}, {"key": "spacy_comparison", "text": "作者还使用spaCy实现了概念识别，其也产生了相似的结果。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2003.11687", "chunk_id": "c-35ae853dec5dd79f61ef4980"}]}, {"key": "detailed_tables", "text": "概念识别的详细性能展示在表2和表3中（证据片段未提供表中数值）。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2003.11687", "chunk_id": "c-35ae853dec5dd79f61ef4980"}]}, {"key": "task_formulation", "text": "该问题被表述为类似于命名实体抽取的token分类任务，数据集由领域专家和文本处理方法在词级别标注，并定义了标注方案以训练序列模型识别系统工程概念。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2003.11687", "chunk_id": "c-7e9b5fdcd1b735fa2b7de65a"}]}, {"key": "domain_specific_need", "text": "现成的命名实体抽取器不足以应对SE常识场景，因为要抽取的是领域特定概念（如'system architecture'或'functional requirements'），而非物理实体，这需要定义新标签并进行微调。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2003.11687", "chunk_id": "c-c721d66657a8536d02534408"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d12-t2", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
{"turn_id": "d12-t3", "session_id": "d12", "turn": 3, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "polyglot_finetune_performance", "text": "《Polyglot Semantic Role Labeling》报告：简单的 polyglot 训练（用多语言词向量合并跨语言训练数据）在多种语言上优于单语基线，唯一例外是捷克语（性能无变化）；训练样本最少的德语、日语、加泰罗尼亚语提升最大，数据集较大的捷克语、中文提升很小或没有，其基线在中文上达到已发表最佳分数水平。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1805.11598", "chunk_id": "c-bb02e8199a80bde6c03e4d79"}, {"paper_id": "1805.11598", "chunk_id": "c-f04cb29df42fdbc211d852cf"}]}, {"key": "seva_finetune_performance", "text": "《Common-Knowledge Concept Recognition for SEVA》报告：使用预训练 BERT 在人工标注的概念数据集上做全量微调（80-20 划分），概念识别任务 F1 分数为 0.89；另用 spaCy 实现的 CR 也得到类似结果。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2003.11687", "chunk_id": "c-35ae853dec5dd79f61ef4980"}]}, {"key": "polyglot_resources", "text": "《Polyglot Semantic Role Labeling》构建标注器时组合的资源是 CoNLL 2009 共享任务中成对语言的资源（如英语部分的监督），通过多语言词向量合并跨语言训练数据，不需要平行数据、跨语言对齐或共享标注；所用数据覆盖 CoNLL 2009 的七种语言。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1805.11598", "chunk_id": "c-8b21bd8c4c41f76753d2758d"}, {"paper_id": "1805.11598", "chunk_id": "c-ab37506cf0e270f6ab4a5722"}, {"paper_id": "1805.11598", "chunk_id": "c-f04cb29df42fdbc211d852cf"}]}, {"key": "seva_resources", "text": "《Common-Knowledge Concept Recognition for SEVA》构建标注器时组合的资源包括：Systems Engineering Handbook 收集的静态领域知识、领域专家与文本处理方法共同构造的、按词级标注并定义标注方案的数据集，以及从系统工程领域创建的缩写和定义等辅助数据集；标签器基于预训练语言模型（BERT）微调。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2003.11687", "chunk_id": "c-31214b784b9f4dcaddc0adf6"}, {"paper_id": "2003.11687", "chunk_id": "c-7e9b5fdcd1b735fa2b7de65a"}, {"paper_id": "2003.11687", "chunk_id": "c-945a37a61c8991cd2adfcf07"}]}, {"key": "comparability", "text": "两篇论文的任务与数据不同：前者是面向 CoNLL 2009 多语言的 PropBank 风格语义角色标注，后者是系统工程领域的概念识别（类似命名实体提取的 token 分类）；二者报告的性能指标（SRL 相对单语基线的改进 vs. 单一 F1=0.89）不在同一数据集或指标下，因此不宜直接比较。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1805.11598", "chunk_id": "c-ab37506cf0e270f6ab4a5722"}, {"paper_id": "2003.11687", "chunk_id": "c-7e9b5fdcd1b735fa2b7de65a"}, {"paper_id": "2003.11687", "chunk_id": "c-35ae853dec5dd79f61ef4980"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, 